{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D4mNSREGZqfcVpMoBFYhpi","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, here's what I found regarding Federico Valeri, KIP-1267, and Cluster Mirroring:\\\\n\\\\n## Key Clarification\\\\n\\\\n**KIP-1267 and KIP-1279 are different KIPs:**\\\\n\\\\n### KIP-1267: Tiered Storage Cost Attribution Metrics\\\\n- **Proposer**: Vaquar Khan (NOT Federico Valeri)\\\\n- **JIRA Issue**: KAFKA-20047\\\\n- **Status**: DISCUSS phase (as of 2026-01-07)\\\\n- **Discussion Started**: 2026-01-07T07:11:33Z on dev@kafka.apache.org\\\\n- **Purpose**: Adds client-id tags to RemoteLogManager metrics to enable operators to attribute remote fetch costs (S3 GETs/egress) to specific consumer groups for chargeback and governance in multi-tenant clusters\\\\n- **Reference**: [discussions.md, lines 3636-3656]\\\\n\\\\n### KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring\\\\n- **Proposer**: Federico Valeri\\\\n- **JIRA Issue**: KAFKA-20186 (Cluster Mirroring epic, created by Federico Valeri)\\\\n- **Status**: DISCUSS phase (initiated 2026-02-13T16:45:21Z or 2026-02-14T07:17:27Z)\\\\n- **Purpose**: Native, broker-level topic replication across clusters (unlike external MirrorMaker 2)\\\\n- **Mailing List**: dev@kafka.apache.org\\\\n- **Reference**: [discussions.md, lines 1222-1234, 1327-1339, 485-496]\\\\n\\\\n## Correction Note\\\\nThere was initial confusion where Cluster Mirroring was referred to as KIP-1267, but **Vaquar Khan corrected this** on 2026-02-14T05:50:03Z, clarifying that Cluster Mirroring is **KIP-1279**, not KIP-1267.\\\\n\\\\n**Sources**: \\\\n- `/store/discussions.md`\\\\n- `/store/issues.md` \\\\n- `/store/people.md`\\\\n- `/store/index.md`\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\",\\\"people.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":31.24,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":397862,\\\"cac